linhas.en:
#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF, please come back.
You've accumulated a lot of fatigue;
any more will be dangerous!

I'm an anti-Heroic Spirit whom people curse;
and I curse back. I'm not worthy of being by
the side of one with a pure mind.

You heard that black mantle girl, did you not?
Beyond here lies the road to hell;
an underworld you can't return alive from.

#C080080080My soul detaches from my body and from the world;
I'm transferring to the space where #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF#C080080080
belongs, to the dimension I'm tuned to.#C080080080#CDEF
